# Screenshots from a physical Mudita Kompakt go here.
#
# Expected files (referenced by README.md):
#   s1_browser.png       — deck browser (root)
#   s3_card_front.png    — card session, front
#   s4_card_back.png     — card session, back
#   s5_empty.png         — empty state (variant A: "No decks found")
#   s6_settings.png      — settings screen
#   s9_browse.png        — browse mode (single card, read-only)
#
# How to capture from a device over ADB:
#   adb shell screencap -p /sdcard/screen.png
#   adb pull /sdcard/screen.png docs/screenshots/s1_browser.png
#
# Native resolution: 800x480 portrait. PNG, monochrome content but PNG colour mode is fine.
